# A quadratic form preserved by the ambient J₄ matrix generators

These binary rows are witnesses found with GAP from the literal source matrices,
using their transposes to obtain a form for left column action. All multiplication
and transpose identities below are checked by the Lean kernel. The form also
vanishes on the displacement image. This does not distinguish the two nonzero
singular homology orbits.

Source matrices: ATLAS J4G1-f2r112B0, attributed in Model.Data. The ATLAS
representation page reports a quadratic form of plus type; the calculation here
supplies its own checked witness and does not assume that report.
-/

